  "reference": "2 Makorinte 11",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuminenu dakuŋiteja kawusupi kanti; chalala, kuminenu dakuŋiteja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nayitiyila mukawu, mukawu waNzambi; muloŋanayotesheli kudi nfumwenu wumu, yowu Kristu, kulonda nakayitwali kudi yena neyi chaŋadima walumbuluka wabulahu dehi iyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa natiyi woma, nami hamwaha yitoŋojoka yenu yakayiluwaŋesha, yifumi munsaŋu yalala nimukujila kwekala mudi Kristu, neyi chamudimbiluwu Evu kudi kapela namaanindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi kukwinza muntu wakushimwina Yesu wacheŋi itwabulili kushimunetu, hela mukutambula spiritu yacheŋi yimwabulili kutambula, hela nsaŋu yayiwahi yacheŋi yimwabulili kutambula, chachiwahi chimukwitejamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natoŋojoki nami hinekala munyima yawapostolu asweja kulema, hela hantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela nabulaŋa kuhosha chachiwahi, hinabula maanaku; tunayimwekeshelichu chalala, mwahita yuma yejima, mukachi kawantu ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komana chinadizozeli, hana hinadiŋi nakuyishimwina nsaŋu yaNzambi yayiwahi chakadi wufwetu nami enu mulemi, natamishili, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyili yuma yayipompelu yi kwawu, hinukutambula wufwetu kudi wena kulonda niyikalakelenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinadiŋi nanenu chakadi yuma, hinadiili yuma yamuntuku; muloŋa chenjiluwu ana kwetu afumini kuMasidoniya, anyinkeli yuma yinabulili. Munsaŋu yejima nadilekesheli nami nibuli kudya yuma yenu, ninichi saŋa nadilekeshela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineli nsaŋu yaKristu yalala yidi mudami, kwosi muntu wukunlekesha kudisamba munu mumpata yaAkayaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyi? Muloŋa nabula kuyikeŋa, tahindi? Nzambi neluki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "China chinelaŋa dikalu, dichi chinukwila nawa, kulonda owu akeŋa kunyinka muloŋa akaŋanyi, nalondi nimwekeshi nachu wena adisambaŋa nawu elaŋa neyi chitwelaŋa etu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wenowu hiyapostolu akutwamba, hiyakwakukalakala akudimbana, adifwikŋaŋa neyi hiyapostolu jaKristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hichakuhayamaku, muloŋa hela yomweni Satana wadifwikŋaŋa neyi kaŋelu kachejeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi neyi aŋamba jindi akudifwikŋa neyi akalakalaŋa nyidimu yaloŋa, hichuma chakalaku. Kukumisha kwawu kwakekala mwomwaya nyidimu yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahoshi cheŋi nami bayi antoŋojoka kudi muntu nindi nasupaku; hela chinekali chochu, antambuli tuhu chakusupa, kulonda ami nawa nidisambuhu chanti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinukuhoshichi hinidi nakuhosha chakunleja kudi Mwantaku, chidi neyi chawusupi nanichi chinukukolesha kudisamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadisambanawu antu amavulu mwaya chisemwa chaheseki, ninami nawa nukudisamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chineli enu aweni muyakwamaana, mwatiyana kuwaha nakwiteja ayisupi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi muntu wukuyiŋa muwuduŋu, hela wukuyidiila yuma yenu, hela wukuyiya yuma yenu, hela wukudinka wanta, hela wukuyibafula mumesu, mwamwitejaŋa tuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahoshi chakudisekesha nachu, chidi neyi hitukweti Ŋovuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kudi muntu wukudisamba, ninami nawa nukudisamba; nahoshi kwami chawusupi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "HiyaHeberu tahindi? Ninami nawa. HiyaIsarela tahindi? Ninami nawa. Hiyanyana kaAbarahama tahindi? Ninami nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalakelaŋa Kristu tahindi? Ami nayibadiki. Nukuhosha chidi neyi muntu waandala. Yami muntu inakabakani chasweja, nituleya twasweja kuvula, ninyinkakambu yakaŋanya kuchinda, ni kufwa kwamapampa kakavulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋeteli kudi aYudeya yikoti makumi awana kubula chimu mapampa katanu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anhumpwili natubama kasatu; aŋasili malola kamu; nadiŋi mumaatu afwilili mumeji kasatu; ifuku dimu nadiŋi nimwaana niwufuku mumeji akunama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimajila amavulu, niwoma wahatuloŋa, niwoma watupondu, niwoma wawakwamuza wami, niwoma wawajentili, niwoma wamumukala, niwoma wamwisaŋa, niwoma wahakalunalwŋi, niwoma wamukachi kawana kwetu akutwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kukabakana nakumona yihuŋu, nikukonkama mafuku amavulu, ninzala, nimpwila, nikubula kudya kakavulu, nimashika, niwuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuma chakubombela kuniyi yuma yahanzi chanlemenenaŋa hefuku hefuku, chochakwakama yipompelu yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi nazeyi chakadi kuzeyami? Hinyi anadimbwishuwu chakubula kutiya kutama ami?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        }
